OL,3,GNEWSANew strategy launched to transform
OL,4,AScottish women's football over 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish FA and Scottish government
OL,7,Fhave launched a new strategy aimed at
OL,8,Ftransforming women's and girls'
OL,9,Ffootball over the next 10 years.
OL,11,FProject 2035, supported by #250,000 of
OL,12,Fgovernment funding this year, aims to
OL,13,Fincrease participation levels,
OL,14,Fstrengthen pathways into the game and
OL,15,Festablish Scotland as a leading nation
OL,16,Ffor women's football by 2035.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
