OL,3,GNEWSANew strategy launched to transform
OL,4,AScottish women's football over 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new taskforce will oversee the
OL,7,Fdelivery of the plan, involving the
OL,8,FScottish government, the SFA, Scottish
OL,9,FWomen's Football, the Scottish Women's
OL,10,FPremier League, PFA Scotland,
OL,11,FSportscotland and Cosla.
OL,13,FThe strategy aims to double the number
OL,14,Fof registered female players in
OL,15,FScotland, while also quadrupling
OL,16,Fattendances and audiences for matches.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
